    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Phew! We got through that ordeal well enough!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Yes, what a wild and exilerating adventure we had traversing the river
        on a coffin. I'm glad I didn't miss out on that!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Y'know Cuan, we may disagree but I'm with you on this one. Those ghost
        pirates came out of nowhere!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: Anyway, the Moorestown Church is just up ahead, lets get a move on
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
